1
00:00:03,095 --> 00:00:05,233
Mila blows: bubbles everywhere!

2
00:00:05,283 --> 00:00:07,138
All round, perfectly round.

3
00:00:07,188 --> 00:00:09,325
Noah tries with a square frame…

4
00:00:09,375 --> 00:00:11,633
and the bubbles are still round!

5
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:16,297
Square, triangle, star: whatever the shape of the frame,

6
00:00:16,347 --> 00:00:18,828
the bubble always ends up as a ball.

7
00:00:18,878 --> 00:00:19,159
Why?

8
00:00:19,922 --> 00:00:21,436
Discovery mission!

9
00:00:23,952 --> 00:00:24,620
Mini mode!

10
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:27,782
A bubble is a very thin skin of soapy water,

11
00:00:27,832 --> 00:00:28,644
full of air.

12
00:00:28,694 --> 00:00:31,734
This skin is stretched: it pulls to shrink,

13
00:00:31,784 --> 00:00:33,509
like a blown-up balloon.

14
00:00:34,292 --> 00:00:35,558
But the air inside stops

15
00:00:35,608 --> 00:00:37,037
it from shrinking too much.

16
00:00:37,087 --> 00:00:40,710
So the skin picks the shape that needs the least skin for that air:

17
00:00:40,760 --> 00:00:41,253
the ball!

18
00:00:43,335 --> 00:00:45,302
When two bubbles stick together,

19
00:00:45,352 --> 00:00:47,760
they share a flat wall: even less skin!

20
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,714
And if the skin dries or tears…

21
00:00:49,764 --> 00:00:50,646
pop, all gone.

22
00:00:51,462 --> 00:00:54,518
On a wet hand, the bubble holds without popping:

23
00:00:54,568 --> 00:00:55,941
the skin doesn't tear.

24
00:00:55,991 --> 00:00:56,847
Mila rolls it…

25
00:00:56,897 --> 00:00:57,350
gently!

26
00:00:58,162 --> 00:01:00,096
That's why bubbles are round.

27
00:01:01,631 --> 00:01:04,678
The bubble's skin pulls to be as small as possible,

28
00:01:04,728 --> 00:01:06,854
and the smallest shape is the ball.

29
00:01:08,162 --> 00:01:11,479
With an adult: twist a piece of wire into a star,

30
00:01:11,529 --> 00:01:13,610
dip it in soapy water and blow.

31
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:14,485
Still round?

32
00:01:15,261 --> 00:01:17,772
And how do we know dinosaurs existed?

33
00:01:17,822 --> 00:01:19,206
The answer tomorrow.
